  "body": "The vendors are no longer using this apartment and their instructions are clear — they are serious about achieving a sale. Now vacant and ready for immediate possession, this represents an excellent opportunity to secure a beachfront apartment in one of Takapuna’s most tightly held complexes.\r\n\r\nPositioned directly on the beachfront at The Rocks, this modern, renovated apartment offers the ultimate low-maintenance coastal lifestyle, with Takapuna Beach literally on your doorstep and the cafés, restaurants and amenities of Takapuna just a short, flat walk away.\r\n\r\n* Two generous double bedrooms plus a dedicated study\r\n* Recently upgraded open-plan living, dining and kitchen\r\n* Beautifully appointed kitchen with granite benchtops, quality cabinetry and modern appliances\r\n* Filtered views through established trees to Takapuna Beach\r\n* Substantial, completely rebuilt outdoor deck\r\n* Master bedroom opening directly to the deck\r\n* Walk-through wardrobe and generous ensuite\r\n* Second bedroom currently configured as an additional living/music room\r\n* Separate office providing an ideal work-from-home space\r\n* Family bathroom with spa bath plus separate guest powder room\r\n\r\nThe three individual car parks are a significant point of difference and exceptionally difficult to replicate in this location, particularly in an apartment of this size and price range.\r\n\r\nPositioned on the first floor, the apartment enjoys excellent privacy. Established trees provide separation from the Promenade walkway while softening the outlook towards the beach and offering additional shelter from wind and activity.\r\n\r\nFor downsizers, professionals, investors or buyers looking for a genuine beachfront base, the combination of location, three-car garaging, one-level living and immediate availability makes this a particularly compelling proposition.\r\n\r\nAll serious interest is encouraged. If you have been considering a beachfront apartment in Takapuna, now is the time to act.",
